        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Negotiate: If you need the moral to reach cap, this is always good\nQuick Shelling: 2 free Hits, 0 cost Cantrip\nLeap Attack: Quick Shelling but stronger and more conditional\nPrecision Aim: Quick Shelling but for Attunement Synergies (Attunment Draw)"
