        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Just remove basics\nPale Shooting Star is nice, it's alot of Tenacity break depending on your build, but 2 cost high\nQuick Shelling and Leap Attack, free damage, cantrips, can't go wrong\nPrecision Aim: Mainly if you have synergies like Forbidden hunger or Selena"
