        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Lazer 1: You lose Afterglow, so you need help, but with buffs double dipping is SO STRONG\nLazer 2: Moves itself to hand on Ravage and 3 Afterglow is good\nLazer 3: Creates 2 homing lazer, but costs AP, unfortunate so Niche Build\nLazer 4: Moves to hand at start of turn, very good\nLazer 5: Move all Lazer L to hand from Grave, Niche Build\n+1 Mark Laser is the best of all worlds, double dipping hits while also having afterglow+mark to break"
          }
