            "en": "Core 1: 3 Homing Lazers is good\nCore 2: Increasing the Exhaust Limit of this card, specifc Niche\nCore 3: Absolutely amazing if you can chain breaks together\nCore 4: The Ratio of Lazers to AP isn't very good, but there's niche strategies\nCore 5: Creates Permanent Homing Lazers, less good then Spam"
